# Viewer access (detail exposure)

**Canonical spec:** `docs/DOMAIN_CANONICALS.md` §15 · **Debt / phases:** `docs/SYSTEM_COHERENCE.md` C16, S7 (VA-0–VA-7).

## Layers (see `DOMAIN_CANONICALS.md` §15.1 + §15.10)

| Layer | Source |
|-------|--------|
| Identity (guest vs user id) | `req.auth` |
| Platform role / admin bypass | `UserRole`, resolver `platform_admin` |
| **Capabilities** (Organize, console, paid publish) | `member-host-status.ts` / `HostStatusDTO` only |
| Map discovery / participation | `joinMode`, `participationMode` — not detail depth alone |
| **Social viewer access** | `activity-viewer-access.ts`, `profile-viewer-access.ts` |
| `computeActivityDetailExposure` | Roster + discovery → exposure — **not** Pro tiers |
| **Entitlements (future)** | Separate service after social exposure — do not bolt onto `computeActivityDetailExposure` |

## Rules

1. **Policy lives on the API** — extend `resolveActivityViewerAccess` + tests before changing product rules.
2. Peek/detail UI uses **`resolvePeekDetailAccess`** + API `viewerAccess` — never **`computeActivityDetailExposure`** in React.
3. **Guest UI** — `guestBrowseGateCopy` / `openGuestSheet` when `gateReason === sign_in` only; `join_required` uses join/footer CTAs.
4. **VA-3 done:** `GET /activities/:id` returns `viewerAccess`; Activity detail page must consume it.
5. **Map peek:** `GET /explore/map` `viewerAccess` + `mapViewerAccessToExplorePeekDetail` — no `computeActivityDetailExposure` in React.
6. **Commerce / venues on map:** `resolveCommerceMapViewerAccess` / `resolvePublicPlaceMapViewerAccess` on explore map rows.
7. **Organize gates:** `organizePublishGateHref` ← `organizeEntitlementDenial` (not ad-hoc profile checks).
8. **Next:** entitlements layer when paid SKUs ship (`applyActivityViewEntitlements`).

Before done: `npm run verify:system:quick`; API changes must keep `activity-viewer-access.test.ts` as the contract.
